	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Doleo, quia tu doles ex capite.<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Bezug auf <ref target="file12755">Nr. 2708</ref>,3f.</note></s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Non miror autem.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Labores enim, quos sustines <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sine modo, quid aliud parerent?</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quibus si adiunxeris vexationes belli prę<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>sentis, gravius laborabis.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Novi, quid hic patiar ego.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Somnus insuavis est <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>partim, partim tollitur, potissimum cum gravius quid nunciatur.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Cibus <pb type="edition" next="402"/> non raro <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>vilescit; potus non delectat; et ab amicis nonnunquam abhorreo.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tandem, ad do<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>minum ubi redeo, sedatur animus, fit quies, voluptas decens dictorum revertitur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Quę durat, quousque deo visum est.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Tum iterum turbę et iterum tranquillitas.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z8"/>Et talem quidem ludum continenter ludere cogor, donec satis hac maxima te<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>mpestate, qua nescio si quid fuerit unquam turbatius.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Age, dominus adsit nobis, ut ista <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>omnia in ipso ferre queamus et per patientiam vincere feliciter!<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. Johannes <hi>Chrysostomus,</hi> Homiliae in Matth., 84, 4 <hi>(MPG</hi> LVIII 756).</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Literas <persName ref="p3138">Theobaldi Hessi</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p3138">Theobald Thamers</persName> Brief <ref target="file12694">Nr. 2647</ref>, den <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> mit <ref target="file12755">Nr. 2708</ref>,11-14, an <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> ausgeliehen hatte.</note> ideo remisi citius, ut obsequerer mandato, quo prohibuist<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>i, ne quis alius videret.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Dum enim <persName ref="p8032">Dryander</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p8032">Francisco de Enzinas</persName>, der damals in <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> wohnte.</note> me accedit, primum post <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>salutationem verbum est: „Nihilne novi habes a <persName ref="p495">Bullingero</persName>?“</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Si retinuissem <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>vel per unum diem, fieri potuisset, ut indicassem illi advenienti sicque roganti.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Dolore crucior porro propter <persName ref="p18250">Mauricium</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Herzog <persName ref="p18250">Moritz von Sachsen</persName>.</note>, si vera sunt, quę et tu adseris.<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Bezug auf <ref target="file12755">Nr. 2708</ref>,15.</note></s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Quis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>putasset in homine, non dico christiano, sed sanguine cuipiam iuncto, esse posse tantam <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>perfidiam?</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Aeque crudele apud me est, quod is agit contra cognatum<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Kurfürst <persName ref="p19065">Johann Friedrich I. von Sachsen</persName>.</note>, atque <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>quod cęsar<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> agit contra <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Sed talis esse dicitur <persName ref="p18538">Carlus</persName>, ut homines <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>magnos ad se pertrahat, prout quenquam novit esse adfectum natura, ut am<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>bitiosum per honorum amplitudinem, avarum per pecuniam, fortem per pollicitationem <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>glorię, etc.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Et ita fecisse narratur glorioso <persName ref="p18250">Mauricio</persName>: Promisit electoratum,<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Siehe schon <ref target="file12717">Nr. 2670</ref>,25-28.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ut ita dicam, et hominem vicit, ut agat contra ius naturę, consanguinitatis, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>affinitatis et inprimis charitatis christianę.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Malus igitur cęsar, qui im<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>pulit; malus <persName ref="p18250">Mauricius</persName>, qui obsequitur.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Mali igitur dum sunt ambo, permittamus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>iudici Christo tum damnandos tum puniendos.<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 7, 1f</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Apg 17, 31f</ref></cit>.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Pręter hęc dum scribunt <placeName ref="l257">Constantienses</placeName> de hybernatione quorundam equitum et peditum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>per Hegoiam et ad <placeName ref="l2528">lacum Bodmicum</placeName><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><placeName ref="l2779">Hegau</placeName> und <placeName ref="l2528">Bodensee</placeName>. - Diese Nachricht wurde von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> an <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> in <ref target="file12755">Nr. 2708</ref>,18-20, mitgeteilt. Zu <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Antwort auf die hier geäußerte Reaktion von <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> s. <ref target="file12768">Nr. 2721</ref>,19-21.</note>, parum me movit, quod hoc est ingenium <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>cęsaris, ut dicat hoc et faciat illud,<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Vgl. bereits <ref target="file12679">Nr. 2632</ref>,5-7.</note> quo homines facilius decipiat.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Et hac <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ratione profecto hactenus non parum profecit.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Addis vero tu hoc loco: „Quod si <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>verum est, videbis, quid futurum sit.“<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">In <ref target="file12755">Nr. 2708</ref>,20.</note></s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Hic non capio.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Quid mineris quove re<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>spicias?</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Cęterum si cęsar cum suis sequitur electorem<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Gemeint ist der Kurfürst von <placeName ref="l749">Sachsen</placeName>; vgl. <ref target="file12747">Nr. 2700</ref>,3-5.</note> totis viribus, non est, ut <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>quis timeat.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Ex <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> venit enim ad senatum nostrum,<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Gemeint ist der Brief des <placeName ref="l491">Straßburger</placeName> Rates an den Rat von <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> vom 10. Dezember 1546 <hi>(PC</hi> IV/1 511f, Nr. 478).</note> dum elector iter <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>facere tentarit per <placeName ref="l2835">Franciam</placeName><note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Siehe dazu <ref target="file12760">Nr. 2713</ref>, Anm. 4.</note>, ad arma <pb type="edition" next="403"/> sic concursum,<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Dass es zur Gegenwehr der <placeName ref="l2835">Franken</placeName> kam, ist belegt in <bibl source="b658">Viglius van Zwichem</bibl> 212 (unter dem 12. Dezember) und 228, Anm. 36.</note> ut, si is noluerit includi <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>a fronte et a tergo, coactus sit deflectere ab itinere coepto.<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Vgl. <ref target="file12757">Nr. 2710</ref>,114-116.</note></s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Venisse <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>igitur ad viam, quę Montium vocatur, <placeName ref="l2322">Bergstraß</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Eine Straße, die sich von <placeName ref="l1779">Darmstadt</placeName> in <placeName ref="l213">Hessen</placeName> über <placeName ref="l210">Heidelberg</placeName> nach <placeName ref="l548">Wiesloch</placeName> in <placeName ref="l572">Nordbaden</placeName> erstreckt.</note> et hac profectum <placeName ref="l157">Francfordiam</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>inde per <placeName ref="l776">Thuringiam</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Vgl. <ref target="file12747">Nr. 2700</ref>, Anm. 5.</note> quam <persName ref="p18250">Mauricii</persName> esse dicunt,<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Zu <persName ref="p18250">Moritz</persName>' Besetzung <placeName ref="l776">Thüringens</placeName> s. <hi>Voigt, <persName ref="p18250">Moritz</persName></hi> 236-241.</note> iturum, etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>De <persName ref="p20225">Gallo</persName><note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">König <persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName></note> nescit quicquam dominus<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23"><persName ref="p17922">François de La Rivière</persName>; s. <bibl source="b197">EA</bibl> IV/1d 729 (zu ff); <bibl source="b480">PC</bibl> IV/1 520 mit Anm. 4.</note>, qui fuit in comitiis <placeName ref="l21">Badensibus</placeName><note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24">Die am 7. Dezember begonnene <placeName ref="l21">Badener</placeName> Tagsatzung; s. <ref target="file12740">Nr. 2693</ref>, Anm. 45.</note>, certi.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Il<lb xml:id="p1z38"/>lud tamen dixit, legatos a suo rege missos <placeName ref="l513">Ulmam</placeName> his diebus; ad quę n<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>egocia, haud constare.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p7706">Granvellam</persName><note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25"><persName ref="p7706">Nicolas Perrenot, Herr von Granvelle</persName>. - Zu diesem Gerücht siehe <ref target="file12758">Nr. 2711</ref>,2-8 mit Anm. 9.</note> quoque esse in <persName ref="p20225">Gallia</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Atqui si verum esset, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>quod misit, dum hęc scribo, <persName ref="p8032">Dryander</persName> iterum e <placeName ref="l473">Sangallo</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26">Dies ist nicht so zu verstehen, als hätte <persName ref="p8032">Enzinas</persName> aus <placeName ref="l473">St. Gallen</placeName> geschrieben. Er befand sich zu dieser Zeit nämlich in <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> (vgl. oben Z. 13-16), von wo er zwei Tage später an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> schrieb (<ref target="file12765">Nr. 2718</ref>). Vielmehr war <persName ref="p8032">Enzinas</persName> hier lediglich der Vermittler einer ihm gesandten Nachricht von <persName ref="p8311">Matthias Claudius</persName> aus <placeName ref="l473">St. Gallen</placeName>. Dieser Brief ist nicht erhalten, doch am 17. Dezember schrieb <persName ref="p8311">Claudius</persName> aus <placeName ref="l473">St. Gallen</placeName> abermals eine Bemerkung zu demselben Gerücht, wie aus einem Exzerpt von <persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> in <ref target="file12768">Nr. 2721</ref>,33- 40, hervorgeht.</note> cęsar uxorem <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>ducet<note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="27">Dieses falsche Gerücht gründet entweder auf der Affäre Kaiser <persName ref="p18538">Karls V.</persName> mit <persName ref="p4343">Barbara Blomberg</persName> in <placeName ref="l410">Regensburg</placeName>, die damals ein Kind (den künftigen Don Juan von <placeName ref="l850">Österreich</placeName>) von <persName ref="p18538">Karl</persName> erwartete, oder auf dem in <ref target="file12755">Nr. 2708</ref>,25f, mitgeteilten Gerücht.</note> forsitan apud Ditem.<note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" n="28">Bei Pluto (Dis), dem Gott der Hölle.</note></s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la">Scribit enim <persName ref="p8311">Matthias Clodius</persName> ex <placeName ref="l18">Augus<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>ta</placeName>, <placeName ref="l361">Nuremberga</placeName>, <placeName ref="l320">Memminga</placeName> venisse illum obiisse.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Addit tamen: „Monstri <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>aliquid alitur.“<note xml:id="fn29" type="footnote" n="29">Vgl. <hi>Adagia,</hi> 2, 4, 98 <hi>(ASD</hi> II/3 394, Nr. 1398).</note></s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Et ego timeo, ne profectus in <placeName ref="l2449">Boemiam</placeName> tentet, quod <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>possit incommodare.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la">De comitiis velim intelligere, quid sit actum.</s>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/>Vale cum tuis et fratribus.</s>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> raptim, nam impulit tabellio<note xml:id="fn30" type="footnote" n="30">Unbekannt.</note> et temporis brevitas.</s>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/>15. decembris anno 1546.</s>
					<s n="43" xml:lang="la">Tuus <persName ref="p8418">Os. Myco.</persName></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div8" corresp="regest8">
				<p>
					<s n="44" xml:lang="la">De <persName ref="p1804">Iodoco</persName><note xml:id="fn31" type="footnote" n="31"><persName ref="p1804">Jodocus Kilchmeyer</persName>.</note> nil quaeror,<note xml:id="fn32" type="footnote" n="32">In Anspielung auf <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Reaktion in <ref target="file12755">Nr. 2708</ref>,34-38.</note> nam pacata sunt, quę videban<lb xml:id="p1z47"/>tur violatura pacem et charit<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>atem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="45" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ministro Christi optimo, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>domino ac fratri in Christo <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>venerando suo.</s>
					<s n="46" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zü[ri]ch</placeName>.<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Textverlust bei Entfernung des Verschlussbandes.</hi></note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>